{"author": "pgaudet", "body": "Dear all, \n\nThe proposal has been made to obsolete GO:0006561 proline biosynthetic process. The reason for obsoletion is that this term represents the same pathway as GO:0055129 L-proline biosynthetic process.\n\nAnnotations are here: \nhttps://github.com/geneontology/go-annotation/issues/5846\n\nEcoCyc\t2 \nMTBBASE\t1   >> automatically replaced\nPINC\t2   >> automatically replaced\nPseudoCAP\t1\nSGD\t4   >> automatically replaced\nTAIR\t11 >> migrated\nTIGR\t2  >> automatically replaced\nUniProt\t6   >> automatically replaced\n\n\n\nMappings: \n- 9 InterPro \n- 2 UniRule\n- 1 KW2GO \n\n\nYou can comment on the ticket: https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/30463\n\nThanks, Pascale \n", "created_at": "2025-06-16T15:05:11Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review"], "state": "closed", "state_reason": "completed", "title": "Obsoletion with replacement :  GO:0006561 proline biosynthetic process", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2025-08-25T17:09:24Z"}
